### =====================================================
### ms-vehiculos - Documentacion de endpoints
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### =====================================================

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Salud del microservicio
GET {{base}}/

### Listar todos los vehiculos
GET {{base}}/vehiculos

### Listar con filtros (estado, tipo, placa)
GET {{base}}/vehiculos?estado=disponible

### Obtener un vehiculo por id
GET {{base}}/vehiculos/1

### Crear un vehiculo
POST {{base}}/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "placa": "DEF456",
    "tipo_vehiculo": "Camion",
    "capacidad_carga": 8000,
    "modelo": "2023",
    "marca": "Volvo",
    "estado": "disponible"
}

### Editar un vehiculo
PUT {{base}}/vehiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "placa": "ABC123",
    "tipo_vehiculo": "Camion",
    "capacidad_carga": 5500,
    "modelo": "2022",
    "marca": "Chevrolet",
    "estado": "mantenimiento"
}

### Eliminar un vehiculo
DELETE {{base}}/vehiculos/3
